<title>MEXICO: New Mexico to Mexico livestock export update--USDA.</title>
<headline>New Mexico to Mexico livestock export update--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly livestock movement update of New Mexico exports to Mexico, to April 12 - USDA. (Livestock per head, year in Jan/Dec calendar year)</p>
<p>	Beef cattle		Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter		     416	     7,700	 N/A</p>
<p>    Calves			    1		   1	 N/A</p>
<p>    Breeding males, females    38	     2,010	 N/A</p>
<p>	Dairy			Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Breeding males, females    72	     1,597	 N/A</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom (525) 7289530))</p>
